  "text": "Annual Report\n\nOur company continued to grow steadily throughout the year, expanding into new markets and improving margins across every product line while keeping customer satisfaction high. Our company continued to grow steadily throughout the year, expanding into new markets and improving margins across every product line while keeping customer satisfaction high.\n\nFinancial results\n\nRevenue rose by twelve percent compared to the previous period. Our company continued to grow steadily throughout the year, expanding into new markets and improving margins across every product line while keeping customer satisfaction high.\n\n- Record quarterly revenue\n- New offices opened\n- Headcount up 8 percent\n\nOutlook\n\nDemand for our international offerings remains strong.\n\nRegional breakdown\n\nRegion | Revenue | Growth\nEMEA | $4.0M | 12%\nAPAC | $2.5M | 9%\n\nThe table above summarises regional performance. Our company continued to grow steadily throughout the year, expanding into new markets and improving margins across every product line while keeping customer satisfaction high.\n\nTwo column section\n\nLEFTCOLUMN Our company continued to grow steadily throughout the year, expanding into new markets and improving margins across every product line while keeping customer satisfaction high. LEFTCOLUMN Our company continued to grow steadily throughout the year, expanding into new markets and improving margins across every product line while keeping customer satisfaction high. LEFTCOLUMN Our company continued to grow steadily throughout the year, expanding into new markets and improving margins across every product line while keeping customer satisfaction high.\n\nRIGHTCOLUMN Our company continued to grow steadily throughout the year, expanding into new markets and improving margins across every product line while keeping customer satisfaction high. RIGHTCOLUMN Our company continued to grow steadily throughout the year, expanding into new markets and imp